le="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;"> 2 17*500*300(3''inner core &amp; 1.5'' inner core)2.34 4/6/8rolls/Box </span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;"> 3 20*500*300(3''inner core &amp; 1.5'' inner core)2.75 4/6/8rolls/Box </span><br/> <span style="color:#009900;font-family:Verdana;"> Customer''s own requirement is available for us such as printed OEM logos and private label or particular size and package style.</span></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');